# Carrion Cruiser {2}{B}: "When this Vehicle enters, mill two cards, then return a creature or Vehicle card from your
# graveyard to your hand." (CR 701.17, 608.2c.) Black Lotus pays the {2}{B} and is sacrificed. Bot1 mills Lightning Bolt and
# Ornithopter, and the graveyard then holds Black Lotus and Lightning Bolt, neither a creature nor a Vehicle (refused), and the
# Ornithopter, which is taken: the choice is made after the mill, from the card just milled. The library keeps its rest.

